     2459, it can only be of type _D_i_s_p_l_a_y_T_e_x_t.  In RFC 3280, _I_A_5_S_t_r_i_n_g is also
     permissible.  Some software (for example some versions of MSIE) may re‐
     quire iiaa55oorrgg.

